hi everyone i'm kevin durant here's a  first look at our new show swagger  no way i'm not gonna make it right coach  back  [Applause]  the genesis of this project was simply  me wanting to depict what went on as a  kid in a youth basketball circuit  swagger is kind of a cross between  friday night lights and youth basketball  that was introduced to me by kevin  durant when i sat with kd i realized i  could create a show that actually had a  lot more to do than basketball it really  became a show about life it's not just  talented people who make it it's  talented people who make the right  decisions swagger is a lessening growing  up the million kids around the country  use basketball as a coping mechanism it  was almost like therapy for us as kids a  place for us to get away from what was  going on at home  [Music]  my son will take your team from good to  oh my god  there will never be a shot in the entire  series where somebody will shoot the  ball and it will cut to the basketball  going through the hoop  reggie was like no you're going to make  these baskets  [Laughter]  the authenticity is something that we  talked about early on that was one of  the first conversations we had is that  we want real basketball players we don't  want to just train actors to play  basketball we want to train basketball  players because that'll give us the most  authentic feel for the show just being  able to play this same sport i love all  over tv just to be known for my craft  just really happy for me let's go scrub  get loud  it's fresh we never seen the competitive  hardcore nature of basketball at 13 14  years old whenever you mess up you have  the spotlight on you but you have the  world watching at such a young age and  the world can be cruel you're not just  building ball players  you're building young men whether it's  high school college or the nba it's a  machine behind us so a lot comes with  that let's keep winning  swagger on the surface means bravado and  confidence but in the context of our  show it really means having a car is  bigger than yourself you can't fake  swagger it's like an energy inside of  you to me swagger means just to be the  best that you can be every single day no  matter what obstacles are in front of  you  so help me god if you don't take those  thoughts off my son i'll have your badge  while we were shooting the world changed  some of the wrong officers you're here  for that protest black people happen to  deal with police brutality and just the  injustice of that it's sad to think  about how many people are going to be  connected to the hard times that we show  in swagger but when you  watch anything that you feel connection  with that's when that piece of art has  the ability to inspire  ultimately it's not a show about  basketball it's a show about growing up  in america and basketball is a backdrop  we are on this journey to  find ourselves to find the cause bigger  than ourselves and so in many ways  that's the sort of spiritual you know  north star if you will for swagger  you walk on that court with swagger you  walk off with swagger  [Music]  you
 

